cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PETRA in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "PETRA — Prime Exponent Tower Recursive Algebra"
abstract: >
  PETRA is a recursive, canonical, shape-first algebra for prime-exponent
  tower structures. It provides immutable shapes, state-scoped positional
  addresses, canonical serialization, and direct structural rewrites
  (SPROUT, SHED, GRAFT, PRUNE). Concrete primes, primality testing, prime
  generation, and integer factorization are outside the initial structural
  core.
type: software
